---
import GoatCounter from '../../components/GoatCounter.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="description" content="Explore a three-dimensional terrain study of Wollumbin and the surrounding Tweed landscape."/><title>Wollumbin | Geospatial Sandbox</title><link rel="icon" href={base + '/favicon.svg'}/><GoatCounter/></head><body>
<header class="top"><a href={base + '/'}>← Portfolio</a><span>CARTOGRAPHIC FIELD STUDIES</span><span>NEW SOUTH WALES</span></header><main>
<section class="heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">TWEED VALLEY · NEW SOUTH WALES</p><h1>Wollumbin</h1><p class="subtitle">Mount Warning</p></div><p class="dek">A three-dimensional study of the mountain and its surrounding valleys, drawn from elevation data and satellite imagery.</p></section>
<section class="viewer-section" aria-label="Interactive Wollumbin terrain model"><div id="viewer" class="viewer" tabindex="0" aria-label="Three-dimensional model of Wollumbin and its surrounding landscape. Drag to rotate; scroll to zoom; right-drag to pan."><img id="fallback" src={base + '/images/wollumbin-satellite.webp'} alt="Satellite view of Wollumbin and the surrounding Tweed landscape"/><div class="viewer-label">WOLLUMBIN <span> / </span> TWEED VALLEY</div><div id="status" role="status">Preparing the terrain…</div></div><div class="viewer-bar"><div class="hint">Drag to orbit <span>·</span> Scroll to zoom <span>·</span> Right-drag to pan</div><div class="actions"><button id="reset" type="button">Reset view</button><button id="top-view" type="button">View from above</button><button id="fullscreen" type="button">Fullscreen</button></div></div><div class="surface-controls" role="group" aria-label="Terrain appearance"><span>Surface</span><button id="satellite" type="button" aria-pressed="true">Satellite</button><button id="relief" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Shaded relief</button><label for="sun">Light direction <output id="sun-value">315°</output></label><input id="sun" type="range" min="0" max="359" value="315"/></div></section>
<section class="story"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE LANDSCAPE</p><h2>A mountain in context.</h2></div><div><p>Wollumbin rises above the Tweed landscape as a remnant central vent of an ancient volcano. This close-up terrain block shows the mountain, forested slopes and surrounding valleys.</p><p>The landscape is shown at 1.5× vertical exaggeration. The block sides are a neutral visual base, not an interpretation of underground geology.</p><p><a href="#detail">Explore the closer LiDAR terrain comparison below</a>.</p><div class="facts"><div><b>~14 × 13 km</b><span>Terrain extent</span></div><div><b>~22 m</b><span>Model grid</span></div><div><b>1.5×</b><span>Vertical display</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="detail-study" id="detail" aria-labelledby="detail-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A CLOSER LOOK · 6 × 6 KM</p><h2 id="detail-heading">Wollumbin in detail.</h2><p>Explore the mountain up close. Compare the LiDAR-derived terrain with the original elevation model, and switch between satellite, aerial imagery and shaded relief.</p><iframe src={base + '/projects/wollumbin-v2-test/?embed=1'} title="Interactive Wollumbin LiDAR terrain comparison" loading="lazy" allow="fullscreen"></iframe><p class="detail-note">The LiDAR surface uses a 6 m display mesh resampled from a 2 m DEM. Both terrain views use 1.5× vertical exaggeration. NSW aerial imagery loads from the NSW Imagery service and may take a moment.</p><p class="detail-note">Detailed terrain: Murwillumbah 2017 LiDAR DEM, © NSW Spatial Services, Department of Customer Service, CC BY 3.0 Australia; tiles extracted from ELVIS on 25 November 2026 and resampled. Aerial imagery: <a href="https://maps.six.nsw.gov.au/arcgis/rest/services/public/NSW_Imagery/MapServer">NSW Imagery service</a>, © State of NSW (Spatial Services), including third-party imagery such as © AAM. Imagery dates and sources vary.</p></section>
<section class="acknowledgement"><p class="eyebrow">PLACE &amp; PEOPLE</p><h2>A place of cultural significance</h2><p>Wollumbin is a place of deep cultural significance to Aboriginal people, particularly the Bundjalung nation. The upper reaches, including the summit, are a declared Aboriginal Place. <a href="https://www.nationalparks.nsw.gov.au/visit-a-park/parks/wollumbin-national-park/learn-more">Learn more from NSW National Parks</a>.</p><p>This study is an interpretation of the landscape, not a guide to access or navigation. For current access information, see <a href="https://www.nationalparks.nsw.gov.au/visit-a-park/parks/wollumbin-national-park">NSW National Parks</a>.</p></section>
<section class="sources"><h2>Sources &amp; credits</h2><p>Terrain: <a href="https://maps.six.nsw.gov.au/arcgis/rest/services/public/NSW_5M_Elevation/ImageServer">NSW 5 m Elevation service</a>, © NSW Department of Customer Service; statewide elevation derived from stereo imagery. The service was sampled at approximately 10–11 m, then averaged to an approximately 20–22 m model grid. Elevation detail and accuracy vary by location, especially beneath vegetation and on steep slopes.</p><p>Surface imagery: modified Copernicus Sentinel-2 data, 3 September 2026, processed from Sentinel-2 L2A, approximately 10 m pixel spacing, accessed via Earth Search / AWS. Colour has been adjusted for display. Terrain and imagery are from different dates and sources.</p></section></main>
<script>
import * as THREE from 'three'; import {OrbitControls} from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';
const viewer=document.querySelector<HTMLDivElement>('#viewer')!,fallback=document.querySelector<HTMLImageElement>('#fallback')!,status=document.querySelector<HTMLDivElement>('#status')!;
const satellite=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#satellite')!,relief=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#relief')!,sunInput=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#sun')!;const fullscreen=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#fullscreen')!;
try{
 const scene=new THREE.Scene();scene.background=new THREE.Color('#0d1414');const camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(36,1,.1,200);const renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,powerPreference:'high-performance'});renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,1.5));renderer.outputColorSpace=THREE.SRGBColorSpace;renderer.toneMapping=THREE.ACESFilmicToneMapping;renderer.toneMappingExposure=1.22;viewer.appendChild(renderer.domElement);
 const controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);controls.enableDamping=true;controls.dampingFactor=.07;controls.minDistance=7;controls.maxDistance=50;controls.maxPolarAngle=Math.PI*.49;controls.screenSpacePanning=true;
 const ambient=new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xe8f0e0,0x725a45,2.4);scene.add(ambient);const sun=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffe1b8,2.8);scene.add(sun);
 function light(){const a=Number(sunInput.value)*Math.PI/180;sun.position.set(Math.sin(a)*15,14,-Math.cos(a)*15);document.querySelector('#sun-value')!.textContent=sunInput.value+'°'}sunInput.addEventListener('input',light);light();
 function home(){camera.position.set(-17,15,20);controls.target.set(0,.3,0);controls.update()}home();document.querySelector('#reset')!.addEventListener('click',home);document.querySelector('#top-view')!.addEventListener('click',()=>{camera.position.set(0,26,.01);controls.target.set(0,0,0);controls.update()});
 fullscreen.addEventListener('click',async()=>{try{if(document.fullscreenElement===viewer)await document.exitFullscreen();else await viewer.requestFullscreen()}catch{status.hidden=false;status.textContent='Fullscreen is unavailable in this browser.'}});document.addEventListener('fullscreenchange',()=>{fullscreen.textContent=document.fullscreenElement===viewer?'Exit fullscreen':'Fullscreen';resize()});
 function resize(){const w=viewer.clientWidth,h=viewer.clientHeight;if(!w||!h)return;camera.aspect=w/h;camera.updateProjectionMatrix();renderer.setSize(w,h)}new ResizeObserver(resize).observe(viewer);resize();
 const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/,'');const imagePromise=new Promise<THREE.Texture>((resolve,reject)=>new THREE.TextureLoader().load(base+'/images/wollumbin-satellite.webp',resolve,undefined,reject));
 Promise.all([fetch(base+'/data/wollumbin-height.f32').then(r=>{if(!r.ok)throw Error();return r.arrayBuffer()}),imagePromise]).then(([raw,texture])=>{
  const heights=new Float32Array(raw),cols=700,rows=600;if(heights.length!==cols*rows)throw Error();texture.colorSpace=THREE.SRGBColorSpace;texture.anisotropy=Math.min(renderer.capabilities.getMaxAnisotropy(),8);
  const geometry=new THREE.PlaneGeometry(13.7,13.3,cols-1,rows-1);geometry.rotateX(-Math.PI/2);const pos=geometry.attributes.position as THREE.BufferAttribute;for(let i=0;i<heights.length;i++)pos.setY(i,Math.max(0,heights[i])/1000*1.5);geometry.computeVertexNormals();
  const material=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({map:texture,color:0xffffff,roughness:1});const terrain=new THREE.Mesh(geometry,material);scene.add(terrain);
  const edges:number[]=[];for(let x=0;x<cols;x++)edges.push(x);for(let y=1;y<rows;y++)edges.push(y*cols+cols-1);for(let x=cols-2;x>=0;x--)edges.push((rows-1)*cols+x);for(let y=rows-2;y>0;y--)edges.push(y*cols);
  const wallPositions:number[]=[], wallIndices:number[]=[];for(let i=0;i<edges.length;i++){const p=edges[i];wallPositions.push(pos.getX(p),pos.getY(p),pos.getZ(p),pos.getX(p),-.45,pos.getZ(p));const n=(i+1)%edges.length;wallIndices.push(i*2,n*2,i*2+1,n*2,n*2+1,i*2+1)}const walls=new THREE.BufferGeometry();walls.setAttribute('position',new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(wallPositions,3));walls.setIndex(wallIndices);walls.computeVertexNormals();scene.add(new THREE.Mesh(walls,new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0x74634e,roughness:1,side:THREE.DoubleSide})));
  const bottom=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(13.7,.08,13.3),new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0x493d31,roughness:1}));bottom.position.y=-.49;scene.add(bottom);
  function setSurface(useSatellite:boolean){material.map=useSatellite?texture:null;material.color.set(useSatellite?0xffffff:0xb8aa8c);material.needsUpdate=true;satellite.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(useSatellite));relief.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(!useSatellite))}satellite.addEventListener('click',()=>setSurface(true));relief.addEventListener('click',()=>setSurface(false));fallback.classList.add('loaded');status.hidden=true;
 }).catch(()=>{status.hidden=false;status.textContent='The terrain could not be loaded. Showing the satellite image instead.'});
 renderer.setAnimationLoop(()=>{controls.update();renderer.render(scene,camera)});
}catch{status.textContent='The 3D viewer could not start. Showing the satellite image instead.'}
</script>
<style>
:global(*){box-sizing:border-box}:global(body){margin:0;background:#11191b;color:#f0eadd;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif}:global(a){color:inherit}.top{height:74px;padding:0 5vw;border-bottom:1px solid #3a4846;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.82rem;letter-spacing:.15em;color:#aab5ae}.top a{text-decoration:none;color:#e5bb89;font-size:1rem;letter-spacing:0}main{max-width:1600px;margin:auto;padding:0 5vw 80px}.heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:50px;padding:55px 0 35px}.eyebrow{color:#d5a873;font-weight:700;font-size:.82rem;letter-spacing:.17em}.heading h1{font:400 clamp(3.5rem,8vw,7.5rem)/.95 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:17px 0 0}.subtitle{color:#bdc8c0;font:italic 1.35rem Georgia,serif;margin:12px 0 0}.dek{max-width:400px;color:#bbc6bf;line-height:1.55;font-size:1.1rem}.viewer-section{border:1px solid #45514c;background:#0b1012}.viewer{height:min(68vw,720px);min-height:420px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.viewer:fullscreen{height:100vh}.viewer canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:100%}.viewer img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;opacity:.75;transition:opacity .5s;z-index:1}.viewer img.loaded{opacity:0;pointer-events:none}.viewer-label{position:absolute;top:22px;left:22px;z-index:2;color:#f3ead9;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.15em;text-shadow:0 1px 7px #000;pointer-events:none}.viewer-label span{color:#d8aa75}#status{position:absolute;left:22px;bottom:20px;background:#101819dd;color:#f3e8d7;padding:10px 15px;z-index:3;font-size:.9rem}.viewer-bar,.surface-controls{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;padding:14px 20px;border-top:1px solid #45514c;color:#aab5ae;font-size:.9rem}.hint span{color:#d2a375;padding:0 6px}.actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.actions button,.surface-controls button{color:#eed9bd;background:#263432;border:1px solid #566760;padding:10px 15px;font:inherit;cursor:pointer}.actions button:hover,.surface-controls button:hover,.surface-controls button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#40554a}.surface-controls{justify-content:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap}.surface-controls>span{margin-right:5px}.surface-controls label{margin-left:auto;color:#d7ded6}.surface-controls output{color:#e5bb89}.surface-controls input{width:180px;accent-color:#d5a873}.story{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.25fr;gap:8vw;padding:85px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #3a4846}.story h2,.acknowledgement h2,.sources h2{font:400 clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.5rem)/1.05 Georgia,serif;margin:12px 0}.story p,.acknowledgement p,.sources p{color:#bdc8c0;line-height:1.7;font-size:1.05rem}.facts{display:flex;gap:35px;margin-top:40px}.facts div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}.facts b{font:400 1.7rem Georgia,serif;color:#f0d0a8}.facts span{color:#aab5ae;font-size:.85rem}.acknowledgement,.sources{max-width:950px;padding-top:60px}.acknowledgement h2,.sources h2{font-size:2.5rem}.sources p{font-size:.9rem}@media(max-width:800px){.top{padding:0 20px}.top span:nth-of-type(1){display:none}main{padding:0 20px 60px}.heading{display:block;padding:40px 0 28px}.dek{margin-top:25px}.viewer{height:65vh;min-height:350px}.viewer-bar{display:block}.hint{line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:12px}.surface-controls label{margin-left:0}.story{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px;padding:55px 0}.facts{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:25px}}
</style><style>.detail-study{padding:75px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #3a4846}.detail-study h2{font:400 clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.5rem)/1.05 Georgia,serif;margin:12px 0}.detail-study>p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:850px;color:#bdc8c0;line-height:1.7}.detail-study iframe{display:block;width:100%;height:800px;border:0;margin-top:28px;background:#0b1012}.detail-study .detail-note{font-size:.9rem}@media(max-width:800px){.detail-study{padding:55px 0}.detail-study iframe{height:760px}}</style></body></html>

